 # Changelog
 
+## 1.7.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- Persist immutable due times with configurable response hours, backfill existing tickets before serving, and gate due output and overdue filtering behind DUE_TIMES=on. Keep the version 1 data format readable by 1.4.0.
+
+## 1.6.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- Import up to 5000 tickets atomically with `POST /tickets/import`, preserving creation order, audit entries and requester notifications.
+
+## 1.5.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- Assign active tickets with `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee`, recording changes and notifying each new assignee.
+- Filter listings by assignee, combining every supplied filter.
+- Persist assignments and show them in CLI listings; append assignee to raw output.
+
 ## 1.4.0 (2025-09-15)
 
 - The operator command line, `bin/tickets.js` (`list`, `show`), and the weekly report, `scripts/weekly-report.js`.
